-
-5. **Alpha and Color Composition:**
-   For each intersected voxel, sample $K$ points along the ray segment $[a, b]$ [S1].
-   - Sample positions:
-     $$
-     t_k = a + \frac{k - 0.5}{K} \cdot (b - a)
-     $$
-     $$
-     \mathbf{p}_k = \mathbf{r}_o + t_k \cdot \mathbf{r}_d
-     $$
-   - Local voxel coordinates:
-     $$
-     \mathbf{q}_k = (\mathbf{p}_k - (\mathbf{v}_c - 0.5 \cdot \mathbf{v}_s)) \cdot \frac{1}{\mathbf{v}_s}
-     $$
-   - Trilinear interpolation of density $\mathbf{V}$ at $\mathbf{q}_k$:
-     $$
-     \text{interp}(\mathbf{V}, \mathbf{q}) = \sum_{i,j,k \in \{0,1\}} (1-q_x)^{1-i}q_x^i (1-q_y)^{1-j}q_y^j (1-q_z)^{1-k}q_z^k \mathbf{V}_{ijk}
