-   - Exponential-linear activation for sharp density [S1]:
-     $$
-     \exp(ix) = \begin{cases} x & \text{if } x > 1.1 \\ \exp\left(\frac{x}{1.1} - 1 + \ln 1.1\right) & \text{otherwise} \end{cases}
-     $$
